1
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:06,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
I mean, yeah.</b></font>

2
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I talked to you that night.</b></font>

3
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:11,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that was just
the springboard.</b></font>

4
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're the one
who took it from there</b></font>

5
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and actually made the jump.</b></font>

6
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:17,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't keep letting your
old self drag you down.</b></font>

7
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:20,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be a stone.</b></font>

8
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But be a gemstone.</b></font>

9
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:24,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

10
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:25,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

11
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

12
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm sweating.</b></font>

13
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My back's on fire.</b></font>

14
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

15
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:12,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd be down to meet up
after class, cool?</b></font>

16
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-It's seat switching day!
-[gasps]</b></font>

17
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TONBO] Here we go!
-[MARIN] 'Bout time.</b></font>

18
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, draw your lot.</b></font>

19
00:02:19,430 --> 00:02:21,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Wait, hold on.
We're moving?</b></font>

20
00:02:21,430 --> 00:02:22,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I hope we'll still be close!
-[UKA] Already?</b></font>

21
00:02:22,810 --> 00:02:23,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But why?</b></font>

22
00:02:24,020 --> 00:02:25,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's too soon!</b></font>

23
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There are things
I need to say to Endou!</b></font>

24
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:29,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You can want more.</b></font>

25
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be a little greedy.</b></font>

26
00:02:31,070 --> 00:02:33,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And as for everybody
who gave you a hard time?</b></font>

27
00:02:33,450 --> 00:02:35,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Know that you're
better than them.</b></font>

28
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

29
00:02:36,570 --> 00:02:37,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

30
00:02:39,990 --> 00:02:41,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Endou?</b></font>

31
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:42,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I really hope
you'll be friends with me!</b></font>

32
00:02:42,910 --> 00:02:44,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...</b></font>

33
00:02:44,250 --> 00:02:45,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

34
00:02:45,790 --> 00:02:47,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Did I mess up?</b></font>

35
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:49,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, what do ya mean?</b></font>

36
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:51,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Were we not friends already?</b></font>

37
00:02:51,380 --> 00:02:52,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

38
00:02:53,050 --> 00:02:55,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[whimpering]
-Huh?</b></font>

39
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:57,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
I thought we were!</b></font>

40
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:58,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's how I saw you!</b></font>

41
00:02:59,050 --> 00:03:01,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Am I wrong?
-I don't think so.</b></font>

42
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:02,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

43
00:03:02,390 --> 00:03:03,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh! Got it.</b></font>

44
00:03:03,890 --> 00:03:05,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] You're just the kinda
girl who needs to hear</b></font>

45
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:06,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>these things out loud.</b></font>

46
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:10,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles] Ha!
You're stuck with me!</b></font>

47
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:11,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

48
00:03:12,570 --> 00:03:14,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Screw last names!
We're friends!</b></font>

49
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So, Uka, call me Ayumi...
-[UKA] Great things</b></font>

50
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:17,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-keep happening to me.
-...from here on out, okay?</b></font>

51
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How am I so lucky?</b></font>

52
00:03:18,990 --> 00:03:20,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SEKI]
C'mon, ladies.</b></font>

53
00:03:20,660 --> 00:03:22,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Save the flirting for after
you've drawn your lots.</b></font>

54
00:03:22,950 --> 00:03:24,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Okay!</b></font>

55
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Oh, right!</b></font>

56
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:27,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
Yo, Seto, what'd ya get?</b></font>

57
00:03:27,330 --> 00:03:29,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Six.
-Hm?</b></font>

58
00:03:29,420 --> 00:03:32,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm three.
And seat three is...</b></font>

59
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:33,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Oh.</b></font>

60
00:03:34,010 --> 00:03:35,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both groaning]</b></font>

61
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:37,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ayumi whimpering]</b></font>

62
00:03:38,470 --> 00:03:40,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka whimpering]</b></font>

63
00:03:40,140 --> 00:03:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

64
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Ayumi?</b></font>

65
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Would you mind
switching seats with me?</b></font>

66
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Ayumi whimpering]
-[UKA] I pulled number 15!</b></font>

67
00:03:48,100 --> 00:03:50,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-It's right next to Seto!
-[gasps]</b></font>

68
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:52,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] Was I seriously
being that obvious about it?</b></font>

69
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:54,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I kinda thought
you two were already</b></font>

70
00:03:54,190 --> 00:03:55,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>going out together.</b></font>

71
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Kinda just a one-way thing.</b></font>

72
00:03:57,910 --> 00:03:59,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't need to do that.</b></font>

73
00:03:59,490 --> 00:04:00,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Really, I'll be okay!</b></font>

74
00:04:00,820 --> 00:04:02,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]
No!</b></font>

75
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna trade so I can sit
close to the teacher!</b></font>

76
00:04:04,620 --> 00:04:05,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's it!</b></font>

77
00:04:05,870 --> 00:04:07,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm seeing miracles everywhere.</b></font>

78
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:09,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can we?</b></font>

79
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:11,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] For me...and her.
-[Ayumi sighs]</b></font>

80
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, thank you.</b></font>

81
00:04:15,380 --> 00:04:16,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
For all of us.</b></font>

82
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

83
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

84
00:04:20,340 --> 00:04:22,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yo, looks like
we're neighbors! Nice!</b></font>

85
00:04:23,060 --> 00:04:24,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
This one might've been</b></font>

86
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:26,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for my own
satisfaction, though.</b></font>

87
00:04:26,390 --> 00:04:27,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-[TOMOYA] Well...</b></font>

88
00:04:27,810 --> 00:04:29,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess I'll be
right next to you.</b></font>

89
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:31,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?</b></font>

90
00:04:31,230 --> 00:04:32,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lucky day!</b></font>

91
00:04:32,730 --> 00:04:35,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
Oof, RIP to your seat, Kai!</b></font>

92
00:04:35,530 --> 00:04:37,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU] No way you'll get
to sleep up there!</b></font>

93
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Miru and Tonbo laughs]</b></font>

94
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-[TONBO] Right.</b></font>

95
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:41,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
Well, he can sleep anywhere.</b></font>

96
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:43,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] No way,
how did this happen?</b></font>

97
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:45,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're up here too?</b></font>

98
00:04:45,410 --> 00:04:47,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Things keep getting better.</b></font>

99
00:04:47,370 --> 00:04:49,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just when I think
my new world is full of light,</b></font>

100
00:04:49,830 --> 00:04:51,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it sparkles even brighter.</b></font>

101
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Uhh.
-Ah?</b></font>

102
00:04:53,710 --> 00:04:54,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

103
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:01,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't see
what's so funny about this.</b></font>

104
00:05:01,340 --> 00:05:02,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

105
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:04,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA]Hey, Ayumi, good morning!
-[AYUMI] Huh?</b></font>

106
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:06,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good morning, Uka!</b></font>

107
00:05:06,140 --> 00:05:07,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Bye!
-[both gasping]</b></font>

108
00:05:07,810 --> 00:05:09,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
I figured she had more to say.</b></font>

109
00:05:09,890 --> 00:05:11,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Was that it?</b></font>

110
00:05:11,980 --> 00:05:13,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did I miss something?</b></font>

111
00:05:13,270 --> 00:05:14,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
It's Uka, she's so funny!</b></font>

112
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:16,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

113
00:05:16,820 --> 00:05:18,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ASUMI] Whatever.
-[UKA] Was that weird?</b></font>

114
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
You're killing me.</b></font>

115
00:05:22,910 --> 00:05:24,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Yesterday,
I made a friend for the</b></font>

116
00:05:24,990 --> 00:05:26,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-first time in my life. -Let's
talk about the trip tomorrow!</b></font>

117
00:05:26,790 --> 00:05:27,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]
All the details are already</b></font>

118
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:28,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-in your guides...
-[UKA] And then,</b></font>

119
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-we had to change seats.
-...but make sure you wear</b></font>

120
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a uniform or gym clothes.</b></font>

121
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:34,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE] Your footwear doesn't
need to abide our dress code,</b></font>

122
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:36,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>though I would recommend
comfortable sneakers.</b></font>

123
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:40,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] It isn't safe for me
to look left or right.</b></font>

124
00:05:40,510 --> 00:05:42,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]...no matter
how many times I say it...</b></font>

125
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:44,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Especially not right.</b></font>

126
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:46,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, did I forget
to do anything today?</b></font>

127
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:48,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What if my hair's
totally messy?</b></font>

128
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:50,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What if there's
something on my face?</b></font>

129
00:05:50,180 --> 00:05:51,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-What if there's lint on my
blazer? -Not my problem.</b></font>

130
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:53,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Leave me alone.</b></font>

131
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:55,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can switch seats
if you'd prefer, Ishimori.</b></font>

132
00:05:55,770 --> 00:05:57,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Oh! No!
-Ah?</b></font>

133
00:05:57,230 --> 00:05:59,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Uh!
-No sweat, she's gonna be fine.</b></font>

134
00:06:00,030 --> 00:06:01,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

135
00:06:01,610 --> 00:06:03,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, yeah! I'm fine!</b></font>

136
00:06:03,570 --> 00:06:05,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks for the offer, though.</b></font>

137
00:06:05,450 --> 00:06:07,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ABE] You're sure?
-Yes.</b></font>

138
00:06:08,450 --> 00:06:09,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Why ask?</b></font>

139
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yo, you goin' out
with Ishimori?</b></font>

140
00:06:12,540 --> 00:06:14,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
No, he's not--</b></font>

141
00:06:14,250 --> 00:06:15,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
'Course not.</b></font>

142
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:18,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's got no social skills.
I'm helping.</b></font>

143
00:06:18,250 --> 00:06:19,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like we can't
already tell, man.</b></font>

144
00:06:20,010 --> 00:06:21,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just a joke.</b></font>

145
00:06:21,130 --> 00:06:22,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your jokes suck.</b></font>

146
00:06:22,470 --> 00:06:23,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I know Kai's type,</b></font>

147
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:25,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and Ishimori's the furthest
thing you could find from it.</b></font>

148
00:06:25,840 --> 00:06:27,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Come to think of it,</b></font>

149
00:06:27,180 --> 00:06:29,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know nothing
about his history.</b></font>

150
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:31,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Has he dated before?</b></font>

151
00:06:31,350 --> 00:06:33,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-What kind of girl is his type?
-[TONBO] Don't be</b></font>

152
00:06:33,350 --> 00:06:35,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-such a buzzkill, dude!
-Lay off! -[UKA] Though there's</b></font>

153
00:06:35,690 --> 00:06:37,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>more than just his love life.</b></font>

154
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:39,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I barely know
anything about him.</b></font>

155
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:42,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But now that we sit
next to each other,</b></font>

156
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:44,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have my chance.</b></font>

157
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:45,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I can learn more.</b></font>

158
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:47,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[speaking in French]</b></font>

159
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:51,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He's good at pen-twirling.</b></font>

160
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:53,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[speaking in French]</b></font>

161
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:55,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I can't believe
I actually sit next to him.</b></font>

162
00:06:55,670 --> 00:06:57,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[speaking in French]</b></font>

163
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:00,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah. Here.</b></font>

164
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:02,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks.</b></font>

165
00:07:03,050 --> 00:07:04,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[speaking in French]</b></font>

166
00:07:04,930 --> 00:07:06,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
That sheet's torn.</b></font>

167
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:07,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-She needs a new one.
-Oh.</b></font>

168
00:07:07,890 --> 00:07:09,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[speaking in French]</b></font>

169
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-Let's fix that.</b></font>

170
00:07:12,850 --> 00:07:14,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, I'm sorry.</b></font>

171
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, thank you!</b></font>

172
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:18,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[speaking in French]</b></font>

173
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

174
00:07:20,650 --> 00:07:22,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

175
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:25,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI] All right, kids,
open up to page 23.</b></font>

176
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:27,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is anybody able
to answer this one?</b></font>

177
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He's asleep.</b></font>

178
00:07:28,620 --> 00:07:30,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He even managed
from the front row.</b></font>

179
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, here we go.</b></font>

180
00:07:32,910 --> 00:07:34,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
Teach with the wind up.</b></font>

181
00:07:35,330 --> 00:07:36,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-And the pitch!
-[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

182
00:07:37,370 --> 00:07:38,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How'd he manage to do that
without even looking?</b></font>

183
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

184
00:07:40,090 --> 00:07:42,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, don't clap
with them, Ishimori.</b></font>

185
00:07:42,170 --> 00:07:43,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

186
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:45,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Figured she would be lame.</b></font>

187
00:07:45,090 --> 00:07:47,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But is the new girl
actually on our side?</b></font>

188
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:49,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought so too!</b></font>

189
00:07:49,090 --> 00:07:50,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYAKA] She seems like the
type who'd look down</b></font>

190
00:07:50,850 --> 00:07:51,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-on class clowns.
-[UKA] Oh, no.</b></font>

191
00:07:51,970 --> 00:07:54,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-But maybe we misjudged her
there. -Is that how I come off?</b></font>

192
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:56,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] You had her mixed up.
-Huh?</b></font>

193
00:07:56,230 --> 00:07:58,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're just seeing
the mask she wears.</b></font>

194
00:07:58,440 --> 00:07:59,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you get to know her, yeah.</b></font>

195
00:08:00,060 --> 00:08:01,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll realize
she's actually pretty cool.</b></font>

196
00:08:01,900 --> 00:08:02,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka gasps]</b></font>

197
00:08:02,980 --> 00:08:04,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah?
I'm so down!</b></font>

198
00:08:04,940 --> 00:08:06,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's good, Ishimori?</b></font>

199
00:08:06,990 --> 00:08:09,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What's...good?</b></font>

200
00:08:10,950 --> 00:08:13,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughing]</b></font>

201
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, what?</b></font>

202
00:08:16,210 --> 00:08:18,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

203
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why'd you bow?</b></font>

204
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:21,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Help.</b></font>

205
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:23,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's the way you're
supposed to respond to that?</b></font>

206
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:26,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one's ever said something
like that to me before!</b></font>

207
00:08:27,050 --> 00:08:29,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just say, "What's good"
back to her.</b></font>

208
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:31,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Uh. Oh.
-What's good!</b></font>

209
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:33,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, what's good, thank you!</b></font>

210
00:08:33,260 --> 00:08:34,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughing]</b></font>

211
00:08:34,770 --> 00:08:35,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!</b></font>

212
00:08:36,020 --> 00:08:37,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai laugh]</b></font>

213
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:39,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hey!
-Kai.</b></font>

214
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:41,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You really shouldn't tease
Ishimori as much as you do.</b></font>

215
00:08:41,900 --> 00:08:43,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Wait, what's happening?
-[KAI] No, I promise I'm not.</b></font>

216
00:08:43,650 --> 00:08:44,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He's teasing me?</b></font>

217
00:08:45,030 --> 00:08:46,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
That's good enough for now.</b></font>

218
00:08:46,690 --> 00:08:48,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Make sure to pace yourself.</b></font>

219
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

220
00:08:50,530 --> 00:08:52,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now that they know
I think you're cool,</b></font>

221
00:08:52,700 --> 00:08:54,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'd better not let me down.</b></font>

222
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:56,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[sighs]
-[KAI] I'll keep my eye on you.</b></font>

223
00:08:58,210 --> 00:08:59,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's magic.</b></font>

224
00:09:00,710 --> 00:09:02,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Think you can make
a hundred friends?</b></font>

225
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:04,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I will.</b></font>

226
00:09:05,460 --> 00:09:06,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Well, let's see it.</b></font>

227
00:09:07,590 --> 00:09:09,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
This seat is magical.</b></font>

228
00:09:11,130 --> 00:09:12,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Wanna meet up by the park?
-Yeah, I can help you!</b></font>

229
00:09:12,590 --> 00:09:14,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you don't make me
wait for you!</b></font>

230
00:09:15,430 --> 00:09:17,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I need to give back his hat.</b></font>

231
00:09:17,220 --> 00:09:18,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
Uh-oh.</b></font>

232
00:09:18,930 --> 00:09:20,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Looks like Kai disappeared.</b></font>

233
00:09:20,770 --> 00:09:23,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-He was just here, though!
-[MIRU] Again?</b></font>

234
00:09:23,110 --> 00:09:24,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU] So weird
how he vanishes sometimes.</b></font>

235
00:09:25,020 --> 00:09:26,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder where he went.</b></font>

236
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:28,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Guess we gotta go find out!
-[UKA] Oh, he does that?</b></font>

237
00:09:29,030 --> 00:09:30,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Okay.</b></font>

238
00:09:30,110 --> 00:09:31,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's another thing
I know about him, now.</b></font>

239
00:09:32,950 --> 00:09:35,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe I should try
looking for him, too.</b></font>

240
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

241
00:09:36,740 --> 00:09:38,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

242
00:09:41,670 --> 00:09:43,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It doesn't feel like
he's going to make it easy.</b></font>

243
00:09:45,380 --> 00:09:48,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know,
not many people come here.</b></font>

244
00:09:48,130 --> 00:09:49,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

245
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

246
00:09:57,310 --> 00:09:58,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

247
00:09:58,430 --> 00:09:59,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The storage room.</b></font>

248
00:09:59,850 --> 00:10:01,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

249
00:10:07,730 --> 00:10:09,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is there anyone here?</b></font>

250
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:11,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

251
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Doesn't look like it.</b></font>

252
00:10:17,870 --> 00:10:19,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

253
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:23,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasping]</b></font>

254
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:26,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

255
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:31,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groaning]</b></font>

256
00:10:31,220 --> 00:10:32,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

257
00:10:33,630 --> 00:10:34,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

258
00:10:37,220 --> 00:10:38,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hi.</b></font>

259
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:42,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you...okay?</b></font>

260
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You scared me!</b></font>

261
00:10:46,980 --> 00:10:48,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I scared you?</b></font>

262
00:10:48,110 --> 00:10:49,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A bunch of us
were looking for you!</b></font>

263
00:10:49,190 --> 00:10:51,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN] Kai.
Where are you?</b></font>

264
00:10:52,070 --> 00:10:53,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Quiet down.
-[MARIN] Kai!</b></font>

265
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:55,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-And shut the door behind you.
-[MARIN] Can you hear me?</b></font>

266
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Sure.
-[Marin groans]</b></font>

267
00:10:57,950 --> 00:10:59,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not over here.</b></font>

268
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...</b></font>

269
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:05,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...</b></font>

270
00:11:05,750 --> 00:11:08,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they said you
disappear sometimes.</b></font>

271
00:11:08,170 --> 00:11:09,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Do you always come here?</b></font>

272
00:11:09,630 --> 00:11:10,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

273
00:11:11,710 --> 00:11:13,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've got a couple of places.</b></font>

274
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This one is for when
I need a quick nap.</b></font>

275
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:18,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Doesn't lunch make you sleepy?</b></font>

276
00:11:18,430 --> 00:11:20,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

277
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:22,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Uh-oh.
Guess I interrupted his nap.</b></font>

278
00:11:23,930 --> 00:11:25,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Why'd you bother checking here?</b></font>

279
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:27,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I was looking
everywhere for you</b></font>

280
00:11:28,020 --> 00:11:29,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I saw that.</b></font>

281
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ugh!
-[UKA] Did I mess up?</b></font>

282
00:11:32,570 --> 00:11:35,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First time that
anyone's found me.</b></font>

283
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guess you win.</b></font>

284
00:11:36,530 --> 00:11:38,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Was that a compliment?</b></font>

285
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:40,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
That wasn't a compliment.</b></font>

286
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:41,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Oh.</b></font>

287
00:11:41,370 --> 00:11:44,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can only really imagine him
surrounded by people,</b></font>

288
00:11:44,370 --> 00:11:46,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so this is a little surprising.</b></font>

289
00:11:47,370 --> 00:11:49,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I should get going.</b></font>

290
00:11:50,170 --> 00:11:51,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
What's up?</b></font>

291
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:52,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's up?</b></font>

292
00:11:52,710 --> 00:11:54,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Aren't you here for a reason?</b></font>

293
00:11:54,510 --> 00:11:55,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!</b></font>

294
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:57,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

295
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanted to return your hat.</b></font>

296
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:00,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, here.</b></font>

297
00:12:00,890 --> 00:12:02,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, yeah.</b></font>

298
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:05,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks so much
for lending it to me.</b></font>

299
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

300
00:12:07,230 --> 00:12:09,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Did you wash it?
-Was that wrong?</b></font>

301
00:12:09,900 --> 00:12:11,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just something
you didn't need to do.</b></font>

302
00:12:11,980 --> 00:12:13,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But still...</b></font>

303
00:12:13,230 --> 00:12:15,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you're always wearing
that hat, aren't you?</b></font>

304
00:12:15,650 --> 00:12:16,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

305
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:19,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I figured maybe it meant
something important to you.</b></font>

306
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

307
00:12:21,780 --> 00:12:23,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Not really.
-[gasps]</b></font>

308
00:12:24,490 --> 00:12:27,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] I'm tired.
Wake me when it's time.</b></font>

309
00:12:27,370 --> 00:12:28,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, sure.</b></font>

310
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:32,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
So, he doesn't mind me here.</b></font>

311
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:34,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

312
00:12:41,430 --> 00:12:42,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I keep on wondering.</b></font>

313
00:12:43,060 --> 00:12:44,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who is he?</b></font>

314
00:12:44,770 --> 00:12:46,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He has so many faces,</b></font>

315
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:48,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I wanted to see them all.</b></font>

316
00:12:48,350 --> 00:12:50,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

317
00:12:52,060 --> 00:12:54,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like, now, I'm curious.</b></font>

318
00:12:54,570 --> 00:12:57,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But maybe I can't know
everything about him.</b></font>

319
00:12:58,990 --> 00:13:00,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Bed head.
-[gasps]</b></font>

320
00:13:01,070 --> 00:13:02,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
My hair's always a mess.</b></font>

321
00:13:02,620 --> 00:13:03,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Specially when I wake up.</b></font>

322
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:05,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hence the hat.</b></font>

323
00:13:05,740 --> 00:13:07,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just got in the habit
of wearing them.</b></font>

324
00:13:07,660 --> 00:13:09,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!</b></font>

325
00:13:09,330 --> 00:13:11,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

326
00:13:11,330 --> 00:13:14,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Wait...is he blushing?</b></font>

327
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:16,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He is! Look!</b></font>

328
00:13:17,050 --> 00:13:18,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

329
00:13:19,420 --> 00:13:22,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The all-too-cool Miura
is blushing!</b></font>

330
00:13:23,890 --> 00:13:25,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
What?</b></font>

331
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:27,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Honestly, it's kinda silly!</b></font>

332
00:13:29,310 --> 00:13:31,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]
Bed head!</b></font>

333
00:13:31,310 --> 00:13:32,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lay off.</b></font>

334
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:34,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

335
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:36,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just can't stop! Sorry!</b></font>

336
00:13:36,690 --> 00:13:38,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

337
00:13:39,530 --> 00:13:41,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Bed head.
-[KAI] Yeah.</b></font>

338
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:43,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Keep laughin'.</b></font>

339
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:46,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] For the first time,
he seems normal.</b></font>

340
00:13:46,620 --> 00:13:48,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like he's the same
as anyone else,</b></font>

341
00:13:48,790 --> 00:13:49,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>flaws and all.</b></font>

342
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

343
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:53,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?
Kai!</b></font>

344
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:55,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
We looked all over for you!</b></font>

345
00:13:55,210 --> 00:13:56,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why?</b></font>

346
00:13:56,300 --> 00:13:58,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN] C'mon now,
that's all you have to say?</b></font>

347
00:13:58,710 --> 00:14:01,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Jeez, you never let us know
where you're running off to!</b></font>

348
00:14:01,680 --> 00:14:04,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, sneak somewhere
with Ishimori?</b></font>

349
00:14:04,340 --> 00:14:06,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Am I supposed
to speak up here?</b></font>

350
00:14:06,260 --> 00:14:08,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, why do you always
disappear on us?</b></font>

351
00:14:09,020 --> 00:14:11,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I get sick of always
being around people.</b></font>

352
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:12,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-What?
-[Tonbo whimpering]</b></font>

353
00:14:13,060 --> 00:14:15,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-No, this is terrible!
-So not us.</b></font>

354
00:14:15,730 --> 00:14:18,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But Ishimori's okay, I guess?</b></font>

355
00:14:18,150 --> 00:14:20,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Yeah, she barely
counts as a person.</b></font>

356
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

357
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:24,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Where'd he go?
-Ah?</b></font>

358
00:14:24,490 --> 00:14:26,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You actually found him, right?</b></font>

359
00:14:26,330 --> 00:14:27,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

360
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:30,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm seeing new sides to him.</b></font>

361
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:33,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Learning everything I can.</b></font>

362
00:14:35,170 --> 00:14:37,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And with each new thing,</b></font>

363
00:14:37,130 --> 00:14:39,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel myself falling
even further in love.</b></font>

364
00:14:40,670 --> 00:14:41,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It can't be stopped.</b></font>

365
00:14:42,010 --> 00:14:43,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

366
00:14:44,380 --> 00:14:46,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My back, it's burning...</b></font>

367
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:49,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it's fine.</b></font>

368
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:51,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

369
00:14:51,100 --> 00:14:52,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Any second now,</b></font>

370
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:55,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could sprout wings and fly.</b></font>

371
00:14:56,100 --> 00:14:57,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

372
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

373
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Today, we have the school trip</b></font>

374
00:15:07,660 --> 00:15:08,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to welcome new students.</b></font>

375
00:15:08,950 --> 00:15:10,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

376
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:12,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, no.</b></font>

377
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:15,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 3C]
Isn't that backpack too big?</b></font>

378
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:16,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Talk about overkill!</b></font>

379
00:15:16,210 --> 00:15:19,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Looks like I messed up again.</b></font>

380
00:15:19,090 --> 00:15:20,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're lookin' good, girly!</b></font>

381
00:15:21,050 --> 00:15:23,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was thinking about
wearin' mine here, too!</b></font>

382
00:15:23,090 --> 00:15:24,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-[AYUMI] Now I wish</b></font>

383
00:15:24,170 --> 00:15:25,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd actually
gone through with it!</b></font>

384
00:15:26,220 --> 00:15:28,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you,
oh, beautiful goddess.</b></font>

385
00:15:28,300 --> 00:15:29,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!</b></font>

386
00:15:29,510 --> 00:15:31,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, have you guys heard?</b></font>

387
00:15:31,100 --> 00:15:32,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Apparently, there's a place</b></font>

388
00:15:32,350 --> 00:15:33,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where you can look up
through the trees</b></font>

389
00:15:33,810 --> 00:15:35,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the branches
make a heart shape.</b></font>

390
00:15:35,270 --> 00:15:36,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

391
00:15:36,350 --> 00:15:38,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hear that?
You like that stuff!</b></font>

392
00:15:38,270 --> 00:15:39,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Yeah, I do.
-[FEMALE STUDENT 3F] Seriously?</b></font>

393
00:15:40,070 --> 00:15:41,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's find it together.</b></font>

394
00:15:41,690 --> 00:15:43,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whoa! Is he?</b></font>

395
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold your horses.</b></font>

396
00:15:45,070 --> 00:15:46,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He doesn't mean
anything by that.</b></font>

397
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:48,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You think he wants more?</b></font>

398
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:50,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nope, he's just that dense!</b></font>

399
00:15:50,490 --> 00:15:52,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Hey, you two coming?</b></font>

400
00:15:52,330 --> 00:15:53,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SATORU] Or what?
-[AYUMI] Yeah!</b></font>

401
00:15:53,410 --> 00:15:56,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ah, best of luck.
-Thank you.</b></font>

402
00:15:56,210 --> 00:15:58,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SATORU] Hm?
-[giggles]</b></font>

403
00:15:58,210 --> 00:16:00,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] But hey,
she still gets to stand</b></font>

404
00:16:00,380 --> 00:16:01,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>next to the boy she likes.</b></font>

405
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:04,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Which is more than
I can say, right now.</b></font>

406
00:16:04,420 --> 00:16:05,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-No way.
-C'mon,</b></font>

407
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:07,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>don't be like that!
Why can't I?</b></font>

408
00:16:07,590 --> 00:16:10,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Maybe he wants space.</b></font>

409
00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:12,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I am dressed
weird today,</b></font>

410
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:14,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I can't blame him.</b></font>

411
00:16:14,180 --> 00:16:15,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?</b></font>

412
00:16:15,810 --> 00:16:18,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I just realized
I'm acting jealous.</b></font>

413
00:16:19,810 --> 00:16:20,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not like I have the right</b></font>

414
00:16:20,940 --> 00:16:22,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-to feel that way.
-Hey, what's up?</b></font>

415
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:24,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just admiring the outfit.</b></font>

416
00:16:24,690 --> 00:16:25,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA] You really
shouldn't make fun of her</b></font>

417
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:27,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like that, dude!</b></font>

418
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] I'm not, though.
-Ah!</b></font>

419
00:16:30,410 --> 00:16:32,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just imagining her choice.</b></font>

420
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Bet she went back
and forth for hours.</b></font>

421
00:16:35,250 --> 00:16:38,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Every day is a new
range of experiences.</b></font>

422
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:40,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

423
00:16:40,170 --> 00:16:42,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Listen up! Stay together!</b></font>

424
00:16:42,210 --> 00:16:43,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOGETHER]
'Kay!</b></font>

425
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:46,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Some of the paths here
are steep.</b></font>

426
00:16:46,170 --> 00:16:47,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-But we're on the flat route...
-Where'd she get the pamphlet?</b></font>

427
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:49,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]..so I could've
worn my uniform.</b></font>

428
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:51,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIKARIN] Hey, mountaineer!
You know the way?</b></font>

429
00:16:51,550 --> 00:16:53,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
"Mountaineer?" Huh?</b></font>

430
00:16:53,310 --> 00:16:55,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah? Is that me?</b></font>

431
00:16:55,310 --> 00:16:56,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, go right!</b></font>

432
00:16:56,980 --> 00:16:59,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]
It's a joke!</b></font>

433
00:16:59,270 --> 00:17:01,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But still, good to know.</b></font>

434
00:17:01,230 --> 00:17:02,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MIKARIN] Ishimori's so funny.
-[gasps]</b></font>

435
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:07,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]
Can you believe she said that?</b></font>

436
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:09,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anyway, guess what Tamaki said!</b></font>

437
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:11,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Oh, I'm sorry.</b></font>

438
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:13,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think I bumped
into something weird.</b></font>

439
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 3H]
Like a freak?</b></font>

440
00:17:14,330 --> 00:17:15,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nah, just a stone.</b></font>

441
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:17,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 3H]
Yeah, that is weird!</b></font>

442
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:18,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 3G]
Right in our way!</b></font>

443
00:17:18,910 --> 00:17:21,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both laughs]</b></font>

444
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:23,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] There's so much I want
to do with my new class.</b></font>

445
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:25,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] With my new friends!
-I got the hat!</b></font>

446
00:17:26,050 --> 00:17:27,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

447
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:30,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Careful there, path's
getting slippery. -Whatever!</b></font>

448
00:17:30,630 --> 00:17:32,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Oh!
-[screams]</b></font>

449
00:17:32,930 --> 00:17:35,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
Oh, uh, thank you!</b></font>

450
00:17:36,270 --> 00:17:38,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So, clumsy.
-[SHIRAISHI] Are you okay?</b></font>

451
00:17:39,350 --> 00:17:41,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I'm just fine!
-[chuckles]</b></font>

452
00:17:41,650 --> 00:17:44,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Sure you're not flustered?
-Kai will never be an option!</b></font>

453
00:17:44,860 --> 00:17:46,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
Way too many rivals!</b></font>

454
00:17:46,530 --> 00:17:47,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
Hey, relax.</b></font>

455
00:17:47,780 --> 00:17:49,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everyone goes
through a Kai phase.</b></font>

456
00:17:49,490 --> 00:17:50,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Tao groaning]</b></font>

457
00:17:50,610 --> 00:17:52,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] Though, of course,
nothing ever comes from it.</b></font>

458
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:54,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only heartbreak.</b></font>

459
00:17:54,490 --> 00:17:57,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But oh, well, who doesn't want
the forbidden fruit?</b></font>

460
00:17:57,790 --> 00:17:58,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plus, it's way too easy
to get lost in those eyes.</b></font>

461
00:17:58,830 --> 00:18:00,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN]
What are you doing, Kai?</b></font>

462
00:18:00,210 --> 00:18:02,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come get your hat!</b></font>

463
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:04,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can probably keep it.
Not like he has a shortage.</b></font>

464
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's bought dozens
since junior high.</b></font>

465
00:18:07,050 --> 00:18:09,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] Actually, you remember
why he started wearing them?</b></font>

466
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
I know!</b></font>

467
00:18:12,590 --> 00:18:14,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Don't tell.</b></font>

468
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:16,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're the only one
who knows my secret.</b></font>

469
00:18:17,180 --> 00:18:18,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What was that?</b></font>

470
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can't just walk away!</b></font>

471
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

472
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:26,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] But he'd
mentioned it so casually.</b></font>

473
00:18:26,570 --> 00:18:27,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I figured it must've
been something</b></font>

474
00:18:28,070 --> 00:18:29,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-everyone already knew.
-[wind whooshing]</b></font>

475
00:18:29,650 --> 00:18:31,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, why was he okay</b></font>

476
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:33,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-telling me something private?
-Whatever, I don't care.</b></font>

477
00:18:34,490 --> 00:18:35,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Stop.</b></font>

478
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:37,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no special reason.</b></font>

479
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:38,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't read into it.</b></font>

480
00:18:39,830 --> 00:18:41,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIKARIN] Look,
there's a perfect little spot</b></font>

481
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:42,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-to sit for lunch!
-[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

482
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:43,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
It's about time!</b></font>

483
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:46,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Uka, ya wanna
have lunch with me?</b></font>

484
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:49,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Oh!
-Ah! Oh, sure!</b></font>

485
00:18:49,550 --> 00:18:51,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ayumi groaning]</b></font>

486
00:18:51,170 --> 00:18:53,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

487
00:18:54,380 --> 00:18:56,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

488
00:18:56,220 --> 00:18:57,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your lunch is so cute!</b></font>

489
00:18:57,600 --> 00:18:59,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Cute girls even have
cute lunches.</b></font>

490
00:18:59,390 --> 00:19:01,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[giggles]
Don't say that!</b></font>

491
00:19:01,350 --> 00:19:03,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] I'm sure your lunch
is just as cute as...</b></font>

492
00:19:03,850 --> 00:19:05,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Didn't want meat?
-Huh?</b></font>

493
00:19:05,770 --> 00:19:06,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quick question.</b></font>

494
00:19:06,860 --> 00:19:09,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You guys know why those girls
are staring up at the sky?</b></font>

495
00:19:09,190 --> 00:19:11,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] Yeah!
Sounds like a good-luck thing.</b></font>

496
00:19:11,690 --> 00:19:13,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a break in the trees,
and apparently,</b></font>

497
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:14,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it makes the sky
look like a heart.</b></font>

498
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:17,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, good luck with that.</b></font>

499
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:20,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai, you think
it's dumb too, right?</b></font>

500
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:23,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-[KAI] Not really.</b></font>

501
00:19:23,250 --> 00:19:26,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TONBO] Quit lying!
-No, it's not a lie.</b></font>

502
00:19:26,880 --> 00:19:29,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Pretty sure I remember
you going to a romantic spot</b></font>

503
00:19:29,380 --> 00:19:30,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like that with a girl before.</b></font>

504
00:19:30,550 --> 00:19:32,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] What?
You're kidding me!</b></font>

505
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:34,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So not like you!</b></font>

506
00:19:34,340 --> 00:19:36,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Satoru, learn how to shut up.</b></font>

507
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:37,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, it's the truth?</b></font>

508
00:19:37,970 --> 00:19:39,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
You can't do that stuff!</b></font>

509
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:41,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's gonna kill
your whole vibe!</b></font>

510
00:19:41,140 --> 00:19:42,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Like I care.</b></font>

511
00:19:43,730 --> 00:19:44,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
That makes sense.</b></font>

512
00:19:45,810 --> 00:19:47,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why wouldn't he?</b></font>

513
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's Miura.</b></font>

514
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:52,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's probably dated
more girls than I can imagine.</b></font>

515
00:19:53,610 --> 00:19:56,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, I can't freak out
over one secret.</b></font>

516
00:19:56,150 --> 00:19:57,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It meant nothing.</b></font>

517
00:19:58,530 --> 00:20:01,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's not into me
or anything like that.</b></font>

518
00:20:02,450 --> 00:20:03,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

519
00:20:03,620 --> 00:20:05,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Hold on,
the sign's pointing us</b></font>

520
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:08,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the rougher path,
isn't that weird?</b></font>

521
00:20:09,460 --> 00:20:11,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Should we really go this way?
But...</b></font>

522
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:13,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Something got you
freezing up again?</b></font>

523
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:15,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Looks like Mister Abe's
group went right.</b></font>

524
00:20:17,050 --> 00:20:19,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, looks that way!</b></font>

525
00:20:19,140 --> 00:20:20,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
So, Mountaineer, we good?</b></font>

526
00:20:22,310 --> 00:20:23,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I'm just
over-thinking things again.</b></font>

527
00:20:25,770 --> 00:20:27,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should go right.</b></font>

528
00:20:27,730 --> 00:20:28,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>HACHIMITSU
HIGH SCHOOL</b></font>

529
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:30,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

530
00:20:34,990 --> 00:20:36,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

531
00:20:36,650 --> 00:20:39,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Has anyone else noticed
the path is steeper.</b></font>

532
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:41,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Yeah.
-[thunder rumbling]</b></font>

533
00:20:41,910 --> 00:20:43,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasping]</b></font>

534
00:20:43,660 --> 00:20:45,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[rain splattering]
[crying]</b></font>

535
00:20:45,580 --> 00:20:47,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAMAKIRI]
Oh, c'mon!</b></font>

536
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:49,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[screams]</b></font>

537
00:20:49,670 --> 00:20:50,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quit running away!</b></font>

538
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But why?
It's coming down.</b></font>

539
00:20:52,420 --> 00:20:54,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I get it, but don't run off!</b></font>

540
00:20:54,630 --> 00:20:55,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We can't get split up!</b></font>

541
00:20:56,630 --> 00:20:58,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What? Why make it sound
like such a big deal?</b></font>

542
00:20:59,050 --> 00:21:01,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We know what path we're on,
so we're not lost or anything.</b></font>

543
00:21:02,510 --> 00:21:03,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Back me up, Ishimori.</b></font>

544
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:06,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] [whimpering]
Uh, I think...</b></font>

545
00:21:08,560 --> 00:21:10,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think we're lost after all.</b></font>

546
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:11,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ALL]
Hm?</b></font>

547
00:21:14,190 --> 00:21:15,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOGETHER]
What?</b></font>

548
00:21:15,570 --> 00:21:17,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[rain splattering]</b></font>

549
00:21:21,370 --> 00:21:23,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TO BE CONTINUED</b></font>

